かし、各陣営は刺青をすべて集めなくても暗号は解けるとすでに気づいていた。煙突から転落した上エ地は、期待した反応を得られなかったことに絶望して最期を迎えるのだった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-01-19","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wKUlixABvphJsIIinS7jhwbcSdS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wKUlixABvphJsIIinS7jhwbcSdS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76757/season/5/episode/3"},{"id":"6821186","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Botaro has his own ideas about what to do with the gold.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-01-26","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Tc6BQTJdFD71P5a6nXegcTFkSK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Tc6BQTJdFD71P5a6nXegcTFkSK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76757/season/5/episode/4"},{"id":"6821187","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Asirpa is captured by Lt. Tsurumi, and learns the truth about the gold.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-02-02","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wXzXs391YA15lh4dEDTUBvDXY34.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wXzXs391YA15lh4dEDTUBvDXY34.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76757/season/5/episode/5"},{"id":"6821188","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Asirpa learns of her father's dark past.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2026-02-09","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AmGPLNZfzQ5ErOHwepvY31JRFZ3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AmGPLNZfzQ5ErOHwepvY31JRFZ3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76757/season/5/episode/6"},{"id